  "description": "ABIHIF crystallizes in the orthorhombic crystal system with space group P b c n. Reported CIF formula moiety: C176 H218 Gd9 O58 1+,N1 O3 1-. From the CIF bond table, Gd1 (Gd) has 8 O neighbors; Gd2 (Gd) has 8 O neighbors; Gd3 (Gd) has 8 O neighbors; Gd4 (Gd) has 8 O neighbors; Gd5 (Gd) has 8 O neighbors; Gd2C (Gd) has 8 O neighbors; Gd3C (Gd) has 8 O neighbors; Gd4C (Gd) has 8 O neighbors; Gd5C (Gd) has 8 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 20 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with three-dimensional metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.631-5.153 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 88.81-168.08°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula [Gd9(μ-OH)10(butylsalicylate)16]+ NO3−.",
